pe field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(3,-2)}=-1-2(3)(-2)=11, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(2,-2)}=-1-2(2)(-2)=7, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(0,-2)}=-1-2(0)(-2)=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/da/da38e55a37f775b3e531b61436ff070901cd88f7ce4a7c9229f096e87159c3c8.png)"] [:db/add "4a81fec4-e469-52d1-b3ae-2d2d1e2bd280" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "4a81fec4-e469-52d1-b3ae-2d2d1e2bd280" :question/answer-fields "b8047dff-ac54-5be9-b9a6-01210efeb5b7"] [:db/ensure "4a81fec4-e469-52d1-b3ae-2d2d1e2bd280" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186172038 :knowledge-point/questions "4a81fec4-e469-52d1-b3ae-2d2d1e2bd280"] [:db/add "1311b306-fa54-5df7-bd97-0195c638d681" :answer/id #uuid "1311b306-fa54-5df7-bd97-0195c638d681"] [:db/add "1311b306-fa54-5df7-bd97-0195c638d681" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "1311b306-fa54-5df7-bd97-0195c638d681" :answer/value "images/13/136c6747f77070e1b5c479f1bbbcaa50ce0d46ddc46fb078f82d76fac1c6ac8a.png"] [:db/ensure "1311b306-fa54-5df7-bd97-0195c638d681" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e7b326d0-4853-5a6d-94ad-c20c8fd6f31f" :answer/id #uuid "e7b326d0-4853-5a6d-94ad-c20c8fd6f31f"] [:db/add "e7b326d0-4853-5a6d-94ad-c20c8fd6f31f" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "e7b326d0-4853-5a6d-94ad-c20c8fd6f31f" :answer/value "images/f3/f3e9db617e68f21ff03b3d5bf57764da9d6a0ddd81f18f718cc2c47b60c35eac.png"] [:db/ensure "e7b326d0-4853-5a6d-94ad-c20c8fd6f31f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "56d25aaf-37ff-585d-9a1c-dcf9044262ec" :answer/id #uuid "56d25aaf-37ff-585d-9a1c-dcf9044262ec"] [:db/add "56d25aaf-37ff-585d-9a1c-dcf9044262ec" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "56d25aaf-37ff-585d-9a1c-dcf9044262ec" :answer/value "images/f9/f99bc2a1d6becc2fe69d65bc6d9b83412e4f6f225059b