"f028d653-d6a4-57e9-987d-557542a2d515" :answer-field/choices "bc622d87-4aca-55d3-8289-82c6e42dc4ad"] [:db/add "f028d653-d6a4-57e9-987d-557542a2d515" :answer-field/choices "7eccabd6-fda5-5243-bac7-bc528f7d0e5f"] [:db/add "f028d653-d6a4-57e9-987d-557542a2d515" :answer-field/correct "bc622d87-4aca-55d3-8289-82c6e42dc4ad"] [:db/ensure "f028d653-d6a4-57e9-987d-557542a2d515" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168" :question/id #uuid "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168"] [:db/add "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3x^{2}-(3)y?$"] [:db/add "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(-2,0)$,$(-1,-1)$,$(-1,3)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,0)}=3(-2)^{2}-3(0)=12, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-1,-1)}=3(-1)^{2}-3(-1)=6, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-1,3)}=3(-1)^{2}-3(3)=-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/b9/b91833eba8558d82b86f66bbc5889f2a6bb2187178170846c12238a3027cd2a0.png)"] [:db/add "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168" :question/answer-fields "f028d653-d6a4-57e9-987d-557542a2d515"] [:db/ensure "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186172038 :knowledge-point/questions "459e46c9-4184-5656-bb8b-3280b2551168"] [:db/add "7762a69f-5289-5df8-bc84-20c5c2b08429" :answer/id #uuid "7762a69f-5289-5df8-bc84-20c5c2b08429"] [:db/add "7762a69f-5289-5df8-bc84-20c5c2b08429" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "7762a69f-5289-5df8-bc84-20c5c2b08429" :answer/value "images/dc/dcf4fa83568b9f4e85e4f8bf1f123b1bfc77b534ad23f452a80d12f8579fed37.png"] [:db/ensure "7762a69f-5289-5df8-bc84-20c5c2b08429" :answer/validate] [:db/add "547596f5-e0bd-55eb-967b-d130fc7d15d8" :answer/id #uuid "547596f5-e0bd-55eb-967b-d130fc7d15d8"] [:db/add "547596f5-e0bd-55eb-967b-d130fc7d15d8" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "547596f5-e0bd-55eb-967b-d130fc7d15d8" :answer/value "images/cf/cf3ae6090229f1b66486c3606840c74a07be0a37559e06bd3429dec9c458a070.png"] [:db/ensure "547596f5-e0bd-55eb-967b-d130fc7d15d8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea" :answer/id #uuid "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea"] [:db/add "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea" :answer/value "images/20/20e196260d4d38071108e0dbb55879348386b1eb2b502fa3b6b4423f0e367339.png"] [:db/ensure "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d" :answer/id #uuid "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d"] [:db/add "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d" :answer/value "images/bf/bf2a18117030301e91784f141d5601a9971f1c6902b2ea6236f2f6b1773f53dd.png"] [:db/ensure "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2eda0ba7-6e23-5033-867a-c0062bad0c84" :answer/id #uuid "2eda0ba7-6e23-5033-867a-c0062bad0c84"] [:db/add "2eda0ba7-6e23-5033-867a-c0062bad0c84" :answer/type :answer.type/image] [:db/add "2eda0ba7-6e23-5033-867a-c0062bad0c84" :answer/value "images/24/24a904a600c6475d1274fa7b9e06dbed168e0ceec72c0d02b7c31dfdc3431292.png"] [:db/ensure "2eda0ba7-6e23-5033-867a-c0062bad0c84" :answer/validate] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/id #uuid "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/choices "7762a69f-5289-5df8-bc84-20c5c2b08429"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/choices "547596f5-e0bd-55eb-967b-d130fc7d15d8"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/choices "2275f5fa-bafb-572f-b6e7-d370b905f9ea"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/choices "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/choices "2eda0ba7-6e23-5033-867a-c0062bad0c84"] [:db/add "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/correct "2671a4fc-1fbc-5996-a738-9b8b5cce8b0d"] [:db/ensure "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" :question/id #uuid "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2"] [:db/add "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" :question/problem "Which of the following diagrams gives the slope field at the points indicated for the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1x+(2)y?$"] [:db/add "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" :question/worked-solution "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(0,1)$,$(-2,0)$,$(2,-1)$.\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(0,1)}=1(0)+(2)(1)=2, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,0)}=1(-2)+(2)(0)=-2, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(2,-1)}=1(2)+(2)(-1)=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/bf/bf2a18117030301e91784f141d5601a9971f1c6902b2ea6236f2f6b1773f53dd.png)"] [:db/add "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" :question/answer-fields "da0ed405-0b07-554e-89ea-aa5037d1c790"] [:db/ensure "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186172038 :knowledge-point/questions "1c183240-5cb2-5523-9f74-95fbf751d6a2"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "c5145cd9-2412-5938-8dd0-f47234506607"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/53/53cdb589176f14a98569cb4661490146fb98b61307e3030e17f0a4144436638e/17592186172038.py"] [:db/add 17592186172038 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186172038 :knowledge-point/validate]]
